                <pb facs="0739" n="677" sameAs="frus:frus1878/pg677"/>

                <p rendition="#center">(Sent from Reynosa April 29, 1878. Received at the city of
                    Mexico, at 10.20 p.m.)</p>
                <p rendition="#flush">Citizen Minister of War:</p>
                <p>The men enlisted in Texas, divided in several parties, have crossed to this side
                    at various points. I am going to write to the commercial agent of Mexico at San
                    Antonio to the end that he may inform the authorities of that State of the evils
                    which the inhabitants of the frontier are suffering in consequence of the
                    periodical invasions of our territory by forces organized and armed in United
                    States territory.</p>
                <closer><signed>SERVANDO CANALES.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
